  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be in an A.P. with common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>. If the standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is 4 and the mean is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WpaDl",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
